# [TIPTOP](../wg/tiptop.html)

## Summary

The TIPTOP (Targeting IP for Space Applications) Working Group met at IETF 127. The session focused primarily on progressing core charter milestones: addressing feedback on the completed Working Group Last Call (WGLC) for `draft-ietf-tiptop-usecase`, reviewing directorate feedback for `draft-ietf-tiptop-ip-architecture`, and debating planetary vs. agency-based addressing models in `draft-limarsjenwar-tiptop-address-space`. Additional presentations covered DNS deployment models, NTP adaptation, and CoAP suitability in deep space environments. The chairs and Responsible AD emphasized focusing future meeting agendas on chartered milestones.

